{title: Halka Halka}
{artist: Sunidhi Chauhan Amit Trivedi Fanney Khan}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
Main [G]dekhu jo [Bm]tuzko to [Em]pyas badhe,        Tu [C]roz, tu [G]roz, do [D]ghunt [G]chadhe
[G]Muzse tu na muj [Bm]hse [Em]kabhi bichde,        Tu [C]roz, tu [G]roz, do [D]ghunt [G]chadhe
Yeh jo [G]halka halka [Bm]suroor hai,        Yeh jo [C]pehla pehla [D]suroor hai
Tera [G]ishq mera [Bm]fitoor hai,        Tera [C]ishq hai ya fito [D]or hai
[C]Maine khud ko tujhpe [G]luta diya,        Tera [Am]hooke khudko [D]mita diya
Yeh jo [G]halka halka [Bm]suroor hai,        Yeh jo [C]pehla pehla [D]suroor hai
Tera [G]ishq mera [Bm]fitoor hai,        Tera [C]ishq hai ya fito [D]or hai
[C]Maine khud ko tujhpe [G]luta diya,        Tera [Am]hooke khudko [D]mita diya
[G]Tu har ek [Bm]pehlu [Em]si khas lage,        Tu [C]paas hai [G]aaj toh [D]pyaas [G]lage
[G]Mehki si tu [Bm]koi mit [Em]has lage,        Tu [C]paas hai [G]aaj toh [D]pyaas [G]lage
Yeh jo [G]halka halka [Bm]suroor hai,        Yeh jo [C]pehla pehla [D]suroor hai
Tera [G]ishq mera [Bm]fitoor hai,        Tera [C]ishq hai ya fito [D]or hai
[C]Maine khud ko tujhpe [G]luta diya,        Tera [Am]hooke khudko [D]mita diya
Yeh jo [G]halka halka [Bm]suroor hai,        Yeh jo [C]pehla pehla [D]suroor hai
Tera [G]ishq mera [Bm]fitoor hai,        Tera [C]ishq hai ya fito [D]or hai
[C]Maine khud ko tujhpe [G]luta diya,        Tera [Am]hooke khudko [D]mita diya
[G]Teri chah mein teri raah mein,        [G]Teri behki behki nigaah mein
[G]Maine khudko tujhpe loota diya
